[Music]  it's possible to use bigquery to analyze  data without a credit card by setting up  the bigquery sandbox environment this  video will show you how to set up your  own bigquery sandbox start by navigating  to the bigquery web UI at console cloud  google.com slash bigquery log into your  Google account or create a new account  if you do not already have one if you  are logging into Google cloud for the  first time you will need to choose your  country and accept the Terms of Service  click agree and continue in order to use  the bigquery sandbox you must create a  project enter a project name and click  create once the project is created you  will be redirected to the bigquery web  UI notice the sandbox banner indicator  in the upper left-hand corner of the  console congratulations you are now  ready to start using the bigquery  sandbox you can load our query data in  this project without an attached billing  accounts usage will be limited to the  same limits as the free tier which can  be viewed at cloud.google.com slash free  any tables views or partitions and  partition tables automatically expire  after 60 days to overcome these sandbox  limits you can choose to upgrade your  project by enabling billing and removing  or updating the expiration time for your  resources happy analyzing  you  [Music]

